    {
      "id": "claim_53d617e673d544d78bcddfca751dbff6",
      "statement": "The hermetic pytest gate runs in test.yml as two jobs — `pytest` (Python 3.12) and `pytest-py313` — rather than a matrix, because a matrix rewrites the check name to `pytest (3.12)` and `pytest` is a required status check, so renaming it leaves branch protection waiting on a context that never reports; the 3.13 leg exists because `requires-python >= 3.12` means 3.12 alone only proves the floor.",
      "evidence": [
