    {
      "id": "claim_08f6f4b800c24b1a8cbfd9db87e64cf5",
      "statement": "test.yml and lint.yml carry deliberately no `paths:` filter on pull_request/push: when a workflow is a required status check, a path filter deadlocks any PR that does not touch the filtered paths because the check never reports and the PR can never merge.",
